Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:11.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}Fishers and woodsmen comb on the river isles,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:19.38,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k50}Guàn{\k46}kàn {\k102}qiū{\k103}yuè {\k166}chūn{\k313}fēng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:19.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}White-crowned, looking on \Nthe autumn moons and spring breezes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:27.94,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k74}Yī{\k124}hú {\k120}zhuó{\k114}jiǔ {\k64}xǐ{\k167}xiāng{\k177}féng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:27.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}With a jar of wine, they merrily gather.
