Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:19.90,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,850,3350,4180)\pos(640,499.839)}Conflicts in the Wu Palace
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.44,0:03:30.35,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In 252 CE, the first year of the Shenfeng era in Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:33.36,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,the ruler of Wu, Sun Quan, fell ill and died.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:38.43,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He had reigned for twenty-four years, \Nenjoying seventy-one years of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:42.69,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The Grand Tutor, Zhuge Ke, \Ncarried out his dying wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.69,0:03:47.09,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and installed his ten-year-old \Nheir, Sun Liang, as Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.09,0:03:50.29,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The era name was changed to the \Nfirst year of the Yuanjian era.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:53.28,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,This news reached the Wei court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.02,0:03:59.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3940,4290)\pos(402.286,491.429)}Sīmǎ Shī\NStyled: Zǐyuán
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.48,0:03:59.30,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Prepare the armies and march \Nby three routes to conquer Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:12.26,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The General who Pacifies the North has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:16.92,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:18.30,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,General Ding, after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.30,0:04:19.57,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor, after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:22.62,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Huge armies from Wei approach our borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:23.84,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,This is an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.46,0:04:27.37,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,The officials want to defend the Yangzi and Jiangdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:29.14,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Perhaps you have a better plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:30.01,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.18,0:04:36.12,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,The Wei army has come to take the dam at Dongxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.22,0:04:37.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(996,486)}Dīng Fèng \NStyled: \NChéngyuān
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.26,0:04:39.42,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,In theory, they're just besieging the\N forts to each side of the river,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:42.72,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,but they're after all of Dongxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:45.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(314.286,483.429)}Zhūgé Kè\NStyled: Yuánxùn
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:45.77,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,You speak the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:51.65,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Sima Zhao knows that Dongxing is \Nthe most crucial area for our nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.65,0:04:56.13,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,If Dongxing is lost, then the Nan and \NWuchang Commanderies are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:04:57.38,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:05:03.96,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Could you lead three thousand naval soldiers, \Nsail up the Yangzi, and reinforce Dongxing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:06.59,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Dare I not give it my all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.53,0:05:18.66,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Approach the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:23.66,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Look! Those are Wu battleships!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:26.40,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,They're approaching! Go report to our generals, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:29.86,Default,General,0,0,0,,General Ding, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.30,0:05:47.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5660,6020)\pos(376,257.143)}Hú Zūn
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.30,0:05:47.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5660,6020)\pos(958,257.143)}Huán Jiā
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.89,0:05:46.08,Default,Hu Zun,0,0,0,,Only thirty ships are approaching. \NWhat is there to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:49.96,Default,Huan Jia,0,0,0,,General, be careful if the Wu army attacks the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:54.41,Default,General,0,0,0,,General, our army does not have a foothold yet.\NBeware the Wei force.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:55.62,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Keep advancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.62,0:05:56.53,Default,General,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:05:58.66,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Generals,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.66,0:06:00.93,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,the Wu army is led by the old general Ding Feng.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.93,0:06:05.20,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,We can't see how many soldiers they have\N and there seem to be no reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.48,0:06:08.44,Default,Hu Zun,0,0,0,,Is that all Ding Feng is capable of?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:12.89,Default,Hu Zun,0,0,0,,Return to camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.10,0:06:29.90,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,A great man should do great deeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:32.19,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Today is the day we bask in glory!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.19,0:06:34.41,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:06:58.10,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:01.32,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The Wu army is attacking our camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:26.82,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Charge towards their base!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:31.61,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}The battle at Dongxing was a total victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:33.75,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Sima Zhao returned back in a rout.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.51,0:08:38.78,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}This is the perfect time to capture the Central Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:40.78,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}I have already sent an envoy to Shu
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:43.69,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}to coordinate an invasion of Wei with Jiang Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.69,0:08:45.06,Default,Jiang Yan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Do not, do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:47.20,Default,Jiang Yan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}If you invade the Central Plains,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:50.17,Default,Jiang Yan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}your duty and loyalty would truly be admirable,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:53.08,Default,Jiang Yan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}but as it has not rained since springtime,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.08,0:08:55.92,Default,Jiang Yan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}sending troops out at this time would be detrimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:09:00.12,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,How dare you, Jiang Yan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:00.70,Default,Jiang Yan,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.70,0:09:04.06,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,You dare speak of risks, demoralizing our army?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.09,0:09:06.69,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Take him out! Behead him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:09.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(259.429,318.857)}Jiǎng Yán
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:08.03,Default,Jiang Yan,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:09.08,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:13.98,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:16.98,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Jiang Yan was witless with his words,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.98,0:09:18.83,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,but do remember his loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.83,0:09:22.80,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,I beg of you to pardon him and show mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.61,0:09:26.25,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor, show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:27.90,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Demote him to a commoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:29.59,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Get him out of our camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.59,0:09:30.26,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.14,0:09:33.44,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:41.94,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Grand Tutor, our plan for invading the north serves our state well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.94,0:09:45.05,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}In my humble view, Xincheng is central to the Wei strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.05,0:09:48.30,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}If we take it first, they will be terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:49.63,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.89,0:09:54.26,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Mobilize the entire army to take Xincheng!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.26,0:09:57.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(297.333,472)}Xīnchéng
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:22.38,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Heed my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:24.13,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.13,0:10:24.59,Default,General,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:33.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(349.333,492)}Zhāng Tè\NStyled: Zǐchǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:37.50,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Heed my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.77,0:10:38.52,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Attack the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:38.84,Default,General,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-Elder General!\N-General!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.95,0:11:13.14,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,You are very ill, general! You must not fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.14,0:11:16.74,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}A real general should die in battle \Nand return wrapped in horsehide!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:18.91,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}That has been my wish my whole life!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.91,0:11:21.19,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}What is a small ailment to me!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.69,0:11:23.32,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Prepare my horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.32,0:11:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes!\N-General!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.61,0:11:28.53,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.30,0:11:30.24,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Move away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:33.86,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:07.98,Default,Messenger,0,0,0,,Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:11.07,Default,Messenger,0,0,0,,The Wu traitor Zhuge Ke has led \N200,000 troops to attack Xincheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.07,0:13:14.70,Default,Messenger,0,0,0,,General Zhang Te has been \Ndefending the city for two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.70,0:13:17.66,Default,Messenger,0,0,0,,He requests reinforcements for the urgent situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:19.84,Default,Messenger,0,0,0,,If he is denied, Xincheng will not last on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.64,0:13:22.79,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Registrar Yu Song.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.79,0:13:23.50,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:25.40,Default,Sīmǎ Shī,0,0,0,,Thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:30.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4420,4820)\pos(937.333,481.333)}Yú Sōng\NStyled: Shūmào
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:27.48,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,My liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.48,0:13:29.82,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,Now that Zhuge Ke is besieging Xincheng,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.82,0:13:31.24,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,we should not engage him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:33.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(956,501.333)}Sīmǎ Shī\NStyled: Zǐyuán
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:33.36,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Why do you say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:36.15,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}The Wu army is not worth worrying over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.15,0:13:39.33,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}It is Shu that we cannot leave unattended.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.33,0:13:41.46,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}After Cao Shuang and his clique were executed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:50.83,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12}his relative, the General of the Right, Xiahou Ba, \Nleft from Yong Province to serve Jiang Wei of Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:53.84,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}At any moment, Xiahou Ba can invade us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.84,0:13:57.46,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}If he emerges from Longxi, Luoyang will be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.98,0:14:01.09,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}So what about Xincheng?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:03.77,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The Wu army came from afar\N with more men than food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.77,0:14:05.66,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}They will run once their food runs out;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.66,0:14:09.20,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}attacking them afterwards will ensure total victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.85,0:14:13.63,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}You should write a letter to Zhang Te.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.63,0:14:15.34,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}You would only have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:18.28,Default,Yu Song,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.15,0:14:33.68,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Why is your defending general \NZhang Te not surrendering?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.05,0:14:36.99,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}You must not know about a law Wei has.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.99,0:14:42.15,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If a city has resisted a siege\N for over one hundred days without any aid,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:45.76,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,{\bord12}then even if one surrenders,\N their families would not be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:48.14,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}You have already besieged us for over ninety days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:50.25,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Please hold back for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.25,0:14:54.54,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,{\bord12}He would then have the city \Nand its people surrender to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.54,0:14:57.08,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}We would like to present its records.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.91,0:15:02.51,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,What conniving words. You are clearly scheming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:06.02,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:07.52,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Behead him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.69,0:15:12.18,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,How regrettable!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:13.71,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.83,0:15:19.12,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,What regrets do you, a dying man, have?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.84,0:15:23.52,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,I regret that you are too intelligent\N and that Zhang Te is too stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:25.52,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.95,0:15:29.93,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,We can only survive for\N one more night if we do not surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.93,0:15:35.28,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,If the city falls or surrenders now, \Neveryone in the city will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:42.08,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,You think you can deceive me \Nwith such sensational words?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.31,0:15:44.44,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Yielding the records is akin to surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:46.80,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}We have not yet defended for one hundred days!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:48.89,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}If the lord of Wei knows, he will execute us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.89,0:15:51.11,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,{\bord12}We die by not surrendering,\N but we die if we do too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.11,0:15:55.16,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,{\bord12}That is one incompetent general killing thousands of soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.97,0:15:59.76,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,I cannot believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:04.12,Default,Xincheng Man,0,0,0,,Believe me or not! You will see the truth in ten days!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.57,0:16:05.65,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.85,0:16:12.68,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,You may remain here for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:16.20,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,After ten days, I will let you die without any regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.09,0:16:20.90,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Heed my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:23.13,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Hold back on attacking the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.13,0:16:23.68,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.57,0:16:27.36,Default,General,0,0,0,,The Grand Tutor orders us to \Nhold back on attacking the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:27.88,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.50,0:16:31.46,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.12,0:16:36.30,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor, do not rest the soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:38.34,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Elder General, you are very ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.34,0:16:39.98,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Why have you come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:41.70,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,-Sit. \N-Grand Tutor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:45.34,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,The enemy wants us to hold back our army!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.34,0:16:48.13,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,You must not be fooled by them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:52.70,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}All the records of that city are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.70,0:16:54.36,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}What is there to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:57.98,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}How can we trust the words of an outside visitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:17:00.38,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}If we maintain the siege for a few more days,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:01.94,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}the north of the city will fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.94,0:17:06.06,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Taking the city and crushing \Nour foe would quickly follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:10.20,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If we rest our soldiers now, \Nthe enemy will be relieved of pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.20,0:17:13.65,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}They can repair the walls and organize themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:16.10,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}If we wait those ten days,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.81,0:17:20.08,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}breaking the enemy will become difficult!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.02,0:17:22.80,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Xincheng is but a tiny locale.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:25.86,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Everything is under my control.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:29.22,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}What harm is there in resting for ten days?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:31.26,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Have you not read Master Sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:35.32,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"To not fight and yet subdue the \Nsoldiers of others is the best strategy."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:36.94,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Grand Tutor,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.75,0:17:41.02,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}our army has fought with the enemy at Xincheng
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:44.06,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}for many days in scorching weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.06,0:17:46.70,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Many soldiers have fallen ill,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.70,0:17:49.89,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}and if we delay any longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.89,0:17:52.10,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}our provisions will run out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.10,0:17:55.04,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}and our army will become demoralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:17:58.20,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}General, you are too sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:18:00.77,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}You should return to your tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:04.83,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Grand Tutor, my sickness is unimportant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:07.32,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}The outcome of our campaign is what matters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.87,0:18:16.51,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Please, order me to attack the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:18.85,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}I have made my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.85,0:18:21.91,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Any more talk of fighting \Nand there will be executions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:22.75,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:25.23,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:32.49,Default,Zhang Te,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:36.16,Default,Zhang Te,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.87,0:18:41.34,Default,Zhang Te,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.30,0:18:43.76,Default,Zhang Te,0,0,0,,Hurrry, this side!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.54,0:18:45.18,Default,Zhang Te,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.41,0:18:52.86,Default,Zhang Te,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry, this side!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:56.98,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor, the Wei army\N finished repairing their walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:58.44,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Zhang Te was cursing on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.44,0:18:59.35,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Cursing what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.35,0:19:01.74,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,He said that since he had six months of supplies,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.74,0:19:04.33,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,how could he ever surrender... surrender to...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.33,0:19:05.39,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.39,0:19:07.24,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,How could he ever surrender to Wu dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.34,0:19:10.78,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,That bastard Zhang Te!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.20,0:19:12.55,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,He dared to deceive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.84,0:19:16.27,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Behead that messenger in public!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.27,0:19:18.32,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Heed my orders! Attack the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:24.91,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.65,0:19:28.14,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Who is blocking us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:31.76,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor, Grand Tutor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.76,0:19:34.22,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,It has been scorching hot for several days!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:37.16,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Many soldiers have fallen seriously ill!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:38.46,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,They do not want to fight;
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.46,0:19:40.13,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,how could we deploy them now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.13,0:19:46.19,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Better to retreat now and await a \Nbetter chance to attack the Central Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.27,0:19:54.22,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Many men have fallen seriously ill!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.01,0:19:56.38,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,How can we...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.68,0:20:01.22,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,fight any longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.91,0:20:03.22,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:09.02,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.80,0:20:16.82,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,General Ding is too sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:19.30,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Send him back to Jiangdong so he can heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.54,0:20:26.52,Default,Zhuge Ke,0,0,0,,Heed my orders! Attack the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.19,0:20:43.60,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor Zhuge Ke of Wu \Nwas too conceited and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:49.40,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He did not listen to the protests of \NGrand General Ding Feng and lost his chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.40,0:20:53.88,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The battle of Xincheng was a major defeat\N for the Wu army, and they retreated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.88,0:20:58.39,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Zhuge Ke was ashamed and feared \Nthat people would speak ill of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.39,0:21:01.14,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He thus blamed his subordinates,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:05.47,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,shaming those with minor faults \Nand beheading those with major faults.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.47,0:21:11.71,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He also ordered his confidant, Zhang Jun,\N to replace Sun Jun in leading the royal guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:21.98,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Kneel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:33.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(310.857,476.571)}Zhāng Yuē
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.91,0:21:33.10,Default,Zhang Yue,0,0,0,,Execute them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:45.21,Default,Teng Yin,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Your command of the royal guards \Nwill be revoked by the Grand Tutor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.21,0:21:49.90,Default,Teng Yin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Your glory or shame is at the mercy of others now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.16,0:21:54.27,Default,Sun Jun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Zhuge Ke killed many dignitaries and able ministers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.27,0:21:56.44,Default,Sun Jun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}He must mean to rebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.97,0:22:00.78,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Elder cousin, you are related to the imperial clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.78,0:22:02.73,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Why not eliminate that traitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.07,0:22:07.71,Default,Sun Jun,0,0,0,,We shall secretly inform His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.82,0:22:11.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(296,474.286)}Sūn Liàng\NStyled: Zǐmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.70,0:23:06.55,Default,Sun Jun,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.26,0:23:30.20,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.90,0:23:33.73,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,I have an imperial edict to execute the traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.66,0:23:50.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,7860,8220)\pos(875.429,481.143)}Sūn Chēn\NStyled: Zǐtōng
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.98,0:23:57.06,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Not long after Zhuge Ke was killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.06,0:23:59.12,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sun Jun died of illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.12,0:24:04.36,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,His younger cousin, Sun Chen, acted as regent, \Nbut took absolute control of the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.36,0:24:08.09,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the third year of the Taiping era, 258 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.09,0:24:10.52,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sun Chen deposed the lord of Wu, Sun Liang,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.52,0:24:15.22,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and named the sixth son of \NSun Quan, Sun Xiu, Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.60,0:24:13.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(336,446.857)}Sūn Xiū\NStyled: Zǐliè
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.22,0:24:17.73,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The era name was changed to the first year of the Yong'an era.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.73,0:24:20.90,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sun Chen was appointed Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.94,0:24:27.64,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,His family were made Marquises. Their authority\N swelled with their control of the imperial guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.40,0:24:41.98,Default,Court Speaker,0,0,0,,His Majesty has decided he will not accept presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.23,0:24:44.82,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,What? He refuses all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.26,0:24:53.62,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,He refuses all of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.62,0:24:55.48,Default,Court Speaker,0,0,0,,Yes, he is not accepting anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.59,0:24:59.07,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,I'll teach you what it means to refuse everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.55,0:25:04.34,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,General of the Left?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.34,0:25:05.06,Default,Zhang Bu,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.06,0:25:07.64,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Share my gifts for more grateful people at my estate!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.34,0:25:08.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(277.333,480)}Zhāng Bù
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.64,0:25:08.65,Default,Zhang Bu,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.13,0:25:12.30,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Well? Are you also refusing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.23,0:25:14.90,Default,Zhang Bu,0,0,0,,I will follow your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.90,0:25:16.59,Default,Zhang Bu,0,0,0,,Chancellor, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.94,0:25:18.53,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.27,0:25:20.14,Default,Sun Ju,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.52,0:25:40.44,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,When I deposed the Prince of Kuaiji, Sun Liang,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.44,0:25:43.96,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,there were many who urged me to become emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.96,0:25:47.61,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,I believed His Majesty to be virtuous and intelligent,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.61,0:25:49.54,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,which is why I enthroned him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.35,0:25:57.67,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Now he has refused all my \N presents, refused all of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.00,0:26:06.32,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,He clearly does not respect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.98,0:26:12.00,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Soon I will teach him what it means to refuse them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.53,0:26:24.85,Default,Shi Shuo,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Sun Chen ordered\N Household General Meng Zong
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.06,0:26:24.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3450,3780)\pos(1009.333,465.333)}Shī Shuò
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.85,0:26:29.58,Default,Shi Shuo,0,0,0,,to secretly send 15,000 soldiers to Wuchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.58,0:26:31.79,Default,Wei Mao,0,0,0,,Before leaving, he opened the arsenal
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.42,0:26:33.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2380,2700)\pos(288,425.333)}Wèi Miǎo
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.79,0:26:33.56,Default,Wei Mao,0,0,0,,and ran off with many weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.68,0:26:38.58,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,He will rebel before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.92,0:26:40.35,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,What can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.03,0:26:43.78,Default,Zhang Bu,0,0,0,,Elder General Ding Feng is wise and strategic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.78,0:26:46.72,Default,Zhang Bu,0,0,0,,You should consult him for any major matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.58,0:26:50.18,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.81,0:27:06.54,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.54,0:27:09.62,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,I have one plan that can rid this country of its traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.62,0:27:11.22,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,What plan do you have, general?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.65,0:27:15.21,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Wait until Your Majesty holds\N a banquet with the ministers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.21,0:27:17.91,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,You can summon Sun Chen to feast and discuss matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.91,0:27:20.62,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,During that time, I will send some men of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.10,0:27:22.30,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,Elder General,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.30,0:27:25.62,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,the safety and power of our empire all depend on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.44,0:27:29.56,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,I shall draft an edict.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.56,0:27:30.47,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.94,0:27:54.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(988,477.333)}Sūn Jù
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.12,0:27:52.10,Default,Sun Ju,0,0,0,,Elder brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.53,0:27:56.12,Default,Sun Ju,0,0,0,,the winds yesterday were fierce, a bad omen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.62,0:27:59.98,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,We control the imperial guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.98,0:28:01.12,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,What is there to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.12,0:28:04.93,Default,Sun Ju,0,0,0,,Elder brother, you still should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.93,0:28:06.12,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.78,0:28:07.83,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.83,0:28:11.64,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,If something is wrong,\N set a fire in the estate as a signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.64,0:28:12.38,Default,Sun Ju,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.06,0:28:13.88,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,To the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.56,0:28:30.94,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,You two generals, how are the preparations?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.46,0:28:34.00,Default,General,0,0,0,,All the imperial guards have been contacted.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.00,0:28:35.48,Default,General,0,0,0,,They are willing to heed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.33,0:28:39.44,Default,General,0,0,0,,Zhang Bu has made preparations in the palace as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.44,0:28:42.12,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Good, wait for Sun Chen to enter the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.12,0:28:43.98,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,then hurry to the camp of the guards
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.98,0:28:46.60,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,and arrest the Sun brothers, seizing power from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.39,0:28:54.06,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,After entering the camp, follow the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.06,0:28:54.50,Default,General,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.75,0:28:57.15,Default,General,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.94,0:29:09.74,Default,Sun Brothers,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.48,0:29:22.88,Default,Sun Ju,0,0,0,,Who is this audacious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.88,0:29:26.06,Default,Sun Ju,0,0,0,,Who dares summon the generals \Nby beating drums in our camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.62,0:29:32.26,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,An edict bade me to inspect the imperial guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.34,0:29:34.76,Default,Sun Ju,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.44,0:29:37.94,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Inspect it then, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.92,0:29:44.58,Default,Sun Ju,0,0,0,,Bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.20,0:29:51.76,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,It also bade me to execute the evil Sun brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.76,0:29:53.28,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,The rest of you will be spared!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.89,0:29:57.45,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,We await your orders, General Ding.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.45,0:29:58.76,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Detain those Sun brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.76,0:29:59.06,Default,General,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.06,0:30:03.69,Default,Sun Brothers,0,0,0,,You betray us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.69,0:30:03.96,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.89,0:30:06.63,Default,Zhang Bu,0,0,0,,Where is the traitor Sun Chen?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.10,0:30:19.31,Default,Zhang Bu,0,0,0,,I received an edict to arrest the rebel Sun Chen!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.87,0:30:22.66,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Zhang Bu is rebelling! Seize him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.75,0:30:24.54,Default,Zhang Bu,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, seize that traitor now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.54,0:30:26.54,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, behead Zhang Bu now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.91,0:30:28.13,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.68,0:30:35.72,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Zhang Bu, you traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.53,0:30:38.01,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Lay down your sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.21,0:30:51.20,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Ding Feng, hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.92,0:30:54.25,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Let's leave the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.90,0:30:58.46,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Order them to make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.12,0:30:59.84,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,Make...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.41,0:31:01.26,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,Make way...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.31,0:31:07.38,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, might you want a chariot to leave the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.25,0:31:11.12,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,Send...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.57,0:31:12.23,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,Send for one...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.85,0:31:16.50,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,General Ding, go now and send for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.50,0:31:17.88,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.23,0:31:21.86,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Prepare the chariot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.13,0:31:25.96,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,His Majesty is leaving the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.28,0:31:40.84,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, get on the chariot, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.02,0:31:42.90,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.45,0:32:13.38,Default,Ding Feng,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, your terror is this subject's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.56,0:32:25.12,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,Sir, you have removed a traitor. Your merit is peerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.12,0:32:28.39,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, General Ding!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.66,0:32:33.86,Default,Zhang Bu,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, we already arrested the Sun brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.86,0:32:35.76,Default,Zhang Bu,0,0,0,,May Your Majesty judge them!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.01,0:32:44.01,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, please let me live!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.01,0:32:45.92,Default,Sun Chen,0,0,0,,I would be content doing hard labor!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.31,0:32:48.42,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.42,0:32:51.34,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,Lead those five brothers \Nbefore the palace and behead them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.34,0:32:52.48,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,Execute their clans to the third degree!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.48,0:32:53.22,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.22,0:32:54.03,Default,Zhang Bu,0,0,0,,Go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.45,0:32:56.53,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.36,0:32:59.50,Default,Zhang Bu,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, please ascend to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.50,0:33:01.89,Default,All,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, please ascend to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.00,0:33:06.39,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,Very well, I shall rely on you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.06,0:33:08.40,Default,Sun Xiu,0,0,0,,Ascend the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.72,0:33:13.61,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,After the ruler of Wu, Sun Quan, died of illness,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.61,0:33:16.92,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,its royal family was in a state of constant turmoil.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.92,0:33:20.25,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Fortunately, the elder minister, Ding Feng, supported it,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.25,0:33:22.28,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and so the Wu state was stabilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.82,0:33:26.58,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the sixteenth year of the Yanxi era of Shu Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.58,0:33:29.36,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Autumn 253 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.36,0:33:34.51,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,the Shu major general, Jiang Wei, \Nundertook Marquis Zhuge's dying wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.51,0:33:36.53,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,of restoring the Han dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.53,0:33:39.97,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,General Xiahou Ba, who \Nsurrendered from Wei, guided them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.97,0:33:43.70,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,200,000 troops were mustered\N to invade the Central Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.76,0:33:46.55,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,... Sima Yi killed Cao Shuang, who was your relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.55,0:33:51.27,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,The entire government of the Cao clan \Nhas been dominated by the Sima brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.27,0:33:56.89,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,I just do not know if those two have \Nthe ambition to swallow the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.89,0:33:59.70,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,and the thought to conquer everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.56,0:34:04.45,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,The Sima brothers just seized\N power and Wei is in disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.45,0:34:07.24,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,They are too occupied to plan against us for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.24,0:34:09.66,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,However, the Wei recently gained two men.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.66,0:34:11.63,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,If they lead soldiers and horses,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.63,0:34:14.50,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,they will pose a major threat to Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.50,0:34:16.64,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Who are these two men?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.64,0:34:19.34,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,One currently serves as Secretary-Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.70,0:34:22.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3140,3460)\pos(301.333,493.333)}Xiàhóu Bà\NStyled: Zhòngquán
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.34,0:34:22.54,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,His name is Zhong Hui, styled Shiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.34,0:34:24.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(310.667,468)}Jiāng Wéi\NStyled: Bóyuē
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.01,0:34:24.88,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Zhong Hui?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.51,0:34:32.79,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Clever since his youth, \Nhis valiance and wit are exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.79,0:34:37.29,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12}When he was seven, he and his \Nolder brother followed their father to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.29,0:34:41.62,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}His older brother was afraid, sweating profusely.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.62,0:34:47.26,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}The Emperor asked, "Why are you sweating?"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.26,0:34:51.86,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The reply was, "I am nervous, \Nhence I am sweating profusely."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.86,0:34:53.93,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}The Emperor asked Zhong Hui,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.93,0:34:55.35,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}"Why are you not sweating?"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.35,0:34:56.65,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Zhong Hui replied,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.66,0:34:59.36,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}"I am nervous, hence I do not dare sweat."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.31,0:35:03.86,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}The Emperor regarded him as extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.86,0:35:06.53,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}As he grew older, he studied military texts,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.53,0:35:08.38,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}attaining deep strategic knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.38,0:35:11.92,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Sima Yi regarded him as extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.02,0:35:15.33,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}The other man serves as a bureaucrat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.33,0:35:18.72,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}His name is Deng Ai, styled Shizai.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.60,0:35:22.52,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Deng Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.66,0:35:27.54,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}He lost his father when he was young,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.54,0:35:29.36,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}but he always had great ambitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.80,0:35:32.54,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Whenever he saw mountains and lakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.54,0:35:34.92,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}he would plan where one could place troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.92,0:35:36.90,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}where they could store supplies,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.90,0:35:39.50,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}and where they could ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.50,0:35:42.22,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}He was scorned by many.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.22,0:35:44.90,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Only Sima Yi regarded him as extraordinary,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.90,0:35:47.53,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}having him assist in military operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.53,0:35:51.02,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}These two men are to be feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.26,0:36:18.62,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,Beloved ministers,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.62,0:36:23.69,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei of Western Shu is joining \Nwith the Qiang to invade Yong Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.69,0:36:24.63,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,May...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.84,0:36:25.38,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,May...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.63,0:36:31.92,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,May the Grand General send troops to resist the foe?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.97,0:36:36.54,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei has invaded us many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.54,0:36:41.27,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Now that Xiahou Ba, relative of the \Ndastardly Cao Shuang, is guiding him,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.27,0:36:43.00,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,he is invading Yong once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.02,0:36:48.73,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,I only wonder if any generals wish to\N lead troops to resist Jiang Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.22,0:36:52.15,Default,Xu Zhi,0,0,0,,I am willing to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.69,0:36:57.18,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Xu Zhi, the General who Assists \Nthe State, your bravery is extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.18,0:36:59.24,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,You can be the vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.22,0:37:02.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(980,488)}Sīmǎ Zhāo\NStyled: Zǐshàng
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.78,0:37:02.20,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Sima Zhao shall serve as the Grand Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.44,0:37:05.53,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Lead the army to Longxi to resist the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.77,0:37:09.56,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,G-Good! Send out the army, send out the army!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.55,0:37:14.68,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.02,0:37:18.59,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Report, sir! The Shu army is behind Mount Tielong,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.59,0:37:23.01,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,using wooden oxen\N and flowing horses to stream food!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.46,0:37:30.49,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,I suspect that Jiang Wei will have to withdraw \Nto Hanzhong before Qiang soldiers arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.40,0:37:32.44,Default,General,0,0,0,,Why do you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.20,0:37:37.80,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Our victories over Shu in the past \Nwere due to cutting off their supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.67,0:37:43.21,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Now the Shu army is transporting food behind Mount Tielong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.09,0:38:00.23,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,The Wei army is coming! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.12,0:38:08.85,Default,Xu Zhi,0,0,0,,Have half the troops escort the supplies to our camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.85,0:38:10.63,Default,Xu Zhi,0,0,0,,I will lead the rest around the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.63,0:38:11.12,Default,General,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.12,0:38:13.30,Default,Xu Zhi,0,0,0,,Follow me and take the back of the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.54,0:38:23.32,Default,Xu Zhi,0,0,0,,General, vehicles are blocking the road ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.32,0:38:25.60,Default,Xu Zhi,0,0,0,,Dismount and remove them!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.60,0:38:25.98,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.78,0:38:30.35,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.21,0:38:50.42,Default,Xu Zhi,0,0,0,,Withdraw!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.44,0:38:52.57,Default,Xu Zhi,0,0,0,,Withdraw!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.62,0:39:00.50,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Xu Zhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.56,0:39:03.61,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Why not dismount and surrender now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.97,0:39:19.56,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,General, our supplies were captured by the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.56,0:39:20.48,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.37,0:39:24.97,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Have our army change into the uniforms \Nand bear the flags of the Wei army.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.97,0:39:26.85,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,I would trouble you to go to the Wei camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.85,0:39:29.02,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,gain entry, then take action from within.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.02,0:39:31.21,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,I will lead the army to follow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.99,0:39:32.53,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.32,0:39:35.70,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,Hurry, change clothes and armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.70,0:39:37.09,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.16,0:39:42.12,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,Change clothes and armor, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.63,0:39:44.82,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.46,0:39:45.14,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.97,0:39:47.10,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.40,0:39:52.67,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.86,0:39:53.93,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.13,0:40:14.26,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.21,0:40:16.34,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.01,0:40:18.04,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.54,0:40:20.06,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,General Xu returns victorious!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.06,0:40:23.48,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,He seized the supplies! Hurry and open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.77,0:40:26.37,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Great, let us see! We will open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.02,0:40:42.18,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Report, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.18,0:40:44.36,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,General Xu captured the\N wooden oxen and flowing horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.36,0:40:45.78,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,He is returning victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.07,0:40:56.41,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Another defeat for Jiang Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.31,0:41:08.07,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Commander, mount your horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.45,0:41:20.19,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.06,0:41:22.74,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.74,0:41:25.18,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Liao Hua of Shu is leading a large army against us!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.50,0:41:28.53,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Escape through the small road! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.98,0:41:41.89,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Commander, Jiang Wei\Nled troops to block off the small road!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.92,0:41:44.37,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,My life is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.51,0:41:46.91,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,My life is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.41,0:41:49.54,Default,General,0,0,0,,Commander, ahead of us is Mount Tielong!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.54,0:41:51.16,Default,General,0,0,0,,We can rest there for a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.16,0:41:53.42,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Up the mountain! Get up the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.49,0:42:06.57,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Up the mountain! Get up the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.06,0:42:29.26,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Heed my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.26,0:42:31.06,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Have the archers guard the mountain pass.

